# Feline Sovereign (2/3) and Sabretooth Tiger (a first-strike 2/1 Cat, 3/2 with Sovereign) attack Bot2 unblocked. The Tiger deals its
# damage in the first-strike combat damage step and Sovereign in the regular one: two events, so "Whenever one or more Cats you control
# deal combat damage to a player" triggers once in each step (CR 603.2c, 510.4), and the second is Sovereign's own damage - it is a Cat
# it controls, not "other". Bot1 destroys Bot2's Mox Emerald with the first and Mox Sapphire with the second; Mox Jet survives.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Feline Sovereign
Sabretooth Tiger
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Plains x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Feline Sovereign.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sabretooth Tiger.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sabretooth Tiger.Power = 3
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Feline Sovereign > Bot2; Sabretooth Tiger > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.CombatDamage]
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald)
? Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot2.Graveyard = Mox Sapphire; Mox Emerald
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet
